# INSTALL PLUGIN
#
#        three defined variables are mandatory which contain snippets of bash code:
#        - prescript
#        - partscript
#        - postscript
#
#        these snippets will be in addition to what's defined for the node or group configuration

# Plugin selection based on the following search path and priority:
#
# 1 node name                 e.g. plugins/boot/scripts/node001.py
# 2 group name                e.g. plugins/boot/scripts/compute.py
# 3 distribution              e.g. plugins/boot/scripts/redhat.py
# 4 default                   e.g. plugins/boot/scripts/default.py
#
# A script listed under 'scripts' on a node or group is loaded by that name in
# addition, e.g. scripts = nodhcp loads plugins/boot/scripts/nodhcp.py.
